<header><h2>0.42.0</h2><time datetime="2026-10-30">30 October 2026</time></header>
<p>Summon the shelf from any app with a shortcut, open your newest artifacts from the menu bar, save a tag as a collection from Edit Tag…, and let agents check their setup with <code>sediment check</code> and follow your INSTRUCTIONS.md. Sediment now runs on macOS 26.0.</p>
